## Getting started

```bash
make setup        # installs Python + Node deps, creates .env
{%- if project_type == 'ml' %}
make train        # trains the first model into models/
{%- endif %}
make dev-api      # http://localhost:8000/docs
{%- if include_frontend %}
make dev-web      # http://localhost:5173 (in a second terminal)
{%- endif %}
```

No `make`? Use the commands inside the [Makefile](Makefile) directly, e.g.
`uv run uvicorn app.main:app --app-dir apps/api --reload`.

## Everyday commands

| Command | What it does |
|---|---|
| `make check` | Lint, tests and structure check (same as CI) |
| `make new-module name=orders` | Scaffold a backend module{% if include_frontend %} + frontend feature{% endif %} |
{%- if include_frontend %}
| `make gen-api` | Regenerate TypeScript API types from the running backend |
{%- endif %}
| `make format` | Auto-format Python code |

